        <div style="margin-top:11.61pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Fairness Opinion of Stifel GMP</font><font style="font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Engagement of Stifel GMP</font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Pursuant to an engagement letter (the &#8220;</font><font style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Stifel GMP Engagement Letter</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221;) dated as of January&#160;9, 2023 between Hut 8 and Stifel GMP, Stifel GMP was retained to act as financial advisor to Hut 8 and to prepare and deliver </font>
        </div>
      </div>
