          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Reviewed the historical trading price and trading volume of the common shares of Hut 8, and the publicly traded securities of certain other companies that Duff &amp; Phelps deemed relevant; </font>
        </div>
