        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-left:69pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">based on the hashrates most recently reported publicly by such companies. The selected companies and corresponding financial data were: </font>
