      <div style="margin-top:6pt;margin-left:69pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Except to the extent reasonably necessary to comply with applicable Law, as expressly contemplated in the Business Combination Agreement, Plan of Arrangement or Articles of Merger, or with the prior written consent of Hut 8 and USBTC, during the Pre-Closing Period, New Hut shall not: </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:6.1pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
