        <div style="margin-top:8pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;font-size:10pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The following tables show the effects on Hut 8&#8217;s historical financial statements of reclassification to align with USBTC&#8217;s financial statement presentation, adjustments to convert from IFRS to US GAAP as a basis of reporting and the translation of Hut 8&#8217;s financial statements from Canadian dollars to U.S. dollars. Balances on the Statement of Financial Position are converted based on Canadian dollar&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;U.S. dollar exchange rate at the end of the reporting period. Balances on the Statement of Operations are converted based on the average exchange rate during the period.</font>
        </div>
