          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.5pt;font-size:10pt;letter-spacing:-0.18pt;">SHARE OWNERSHIP OF CERTAIN BENEFICIAL OWNERS AND MANAGEMENT/DIRECTORS OF USBTC</font><font style="font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;">&#8203;<font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font></font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:11.5pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">The following table sets forth certain information with respect to the beneficial ownership of USBTC voting securities as of October&#160;27, 2023 for: </font>
        </div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:5.8pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:left; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
