          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Operating segments are defined as components of an enterprise about which separate financial information is available that is regularly reviewed by the chief operating decision maker (&#8220;</font><font style="font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">CODM</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8221;), which may be an </font>
