        <div style="text-align:center; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;font-size:10pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">U.S. Data Mining Group, Inc. and Subsidiaries </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:6pt; text-align:center; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-weight:bold;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;font-size:10pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements</font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;font-size:10pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">Hosting Services Agreement with Celsius</font><font style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;font-size:10pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">In August&#160;2023, a USBTC subsidiary entered into a hosting services agreement with Celsius to host approximately 8,500 miners at the Company&#8217;s Niagara Falls facility. The initial term is for one year provided that the Fahrenheit sponsored Chapter&#160;11 Plan of Reorganization filed in </font><font style="font-style:italic;letter-spacing:0.2pt;">In re Celsius Network LLC, et al</font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">. is confirmed by the U.S. Bankruptcy Court for the Southern District of New York within twelve (12) months of August&#160;8, 2023. The term shall automatically renew for four (4)&#160;consecutive one (1)&#160;year terms unless cancelled in accordance with the cancellation terms in the agreement.</font>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:24pt;margin-bottom:19.71pt;margin-left:69pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="margin-top:5pt; text-align:center; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;font-size:10pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">F-33</font>
          <br >
        </div>
      </div>
      <hr >
    </div>
