          <br >
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:6pt;height:660pt;margin-left:69pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:justify; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" line-height:12pt; text-align:justify; margin-left:30pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Evaluate the appropriateness of accounting policies used and the reasonableness of significant accounting estimates made by management, as well as evaluate the overall presentation of the consolidated financial statements. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style=" float:left; margin-left:20pt; line-height:12pt; margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; width:10pt;white-space:nowrap;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">&#8226;</font>
          <br >
        </div>
        <div style=" margin-top:6pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:justify; margin-left:30pt;">
          <!--blacklining:none;-->
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Conclude whether, in our judgment, there are conditions or events, considered in the aggregate, that raise substantial doubt about the Company&#8217;s ability to continue as a going concern for a reasonable period of time. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="clear:both; padding:0pt; margin:0pt;font-size:0pt;line-height:0pt;">&#8203;</div>
        <div style="margin-top:8pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">We are required to communicate with those charged with governance regarding, among other matters, the planned scope and timing of the audit, significant audit findings, and certain internal control related matters that we identified during the audit. </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; text-align:justify; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">/s/ L J Soldinger Associates, LLC </font>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;">
          <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Deer Park, Illinois, United States of America </font> <br ><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">March&#160;29, 2023</font></div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:24pt;margin-bottom:19.71pt;margin-left:69pt;width:456pt;">
